# Runtime state and diagnostics now live outside the install directory (see
# PLAN.md section 8), but these are kept ignored so a pre-move checkout, or a
# stray local run, can never commit them: known_pads.json holds the MAC address
# of every controller ever seen, launch.log records ROM paths, and phase0's
# reports include the host's own Bluetooth adapter address, which identifies
# the machine.
state/
reports/
*.json.bak

__pycache__/
*.pyc
